},{"type":"person","id":206919,"image_path":"/4eX0XyD9ImmJg26ED3BHRXpvzzg.jpg","name":"Daniel Kaluuya","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":419430,"name":"Get Out","image_path":"/A0RoSZh8PEYJgDMgM2EV7Ycz3dR.jpg","director":"Jordan Peele","winner":false}},{"type":"person","id":11856,"image_path":"/9HI2GTfIKuT628XPK5d1AEteR05.jpg","name":"Daniel Day-Lewis","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":400617,"name":"Phantom Thread","image_path":"/tNbAIYx1dDX2WXrwUxQuMziiSTD.jpg","director":"Paul Thomas Anderson","winner":false}},{"type":"person","id":5292,"image_path":"/cEU2Vrdo83izpGmOvbVAOz5jCof.jpg","name":"Denzel Washington","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":413362,"name":"Roman J. Israel, Esq.","image_path":"/ciq2V1G4dj3GLFBfQGY1gqvPcbK.jpg","director":"Dan Gilroy","winner":false}}]},{"type":"block_special","title":"Ceremony","description":"Despite mixed reviews of the previous ceremony, the Academy rehired Michael De Luca and Jennifer Todd to produce the event for the second year in a row. In May 2017, another decision mirroring that year's ceremony was announced: Jimmy Kimmel would host again. Kimmel said he was thrilled to helm the gala for another year: \"Hosting the Oscars was a highlight of my career and I am grateful to Cheryl (Boone Isaacs), Dawn (Hudson) and the Academy for inviting me back to work with De Luca and Todd. If you thought we screwed up the ending of this year's show, wait until you see what we have planned for the 90th!\" The host thus promoted the ceremony with an intense campaign of numerous commercials and interviews on his talk show, Jimmy Kimmel Live!.<br/><br/>\n\nOn December 4, 2017, it was announced that the pre-show and opening monologue had been scheduled thirty minutes earlier than in previous broadcasts. In the first half of the nominations announcement, on January 23, 2018, the category presentations were pre-recorded by actresses Priyanka Chopra, Rosario Dawson, Gal Gadot, Salma Hayek, Michelle Rodriguez, Zoe Saldana, Molly Shannon, Rebel Wilson and Michelle Yeoh. <br/><br/>\n\nBy awards tradition, the previous year's Best Actor winner usually presents the Oscar for Best Actress; on this occasion, however, Casey Affleck chose not to present because of sexual harassment allegations. In his place, Jodie Foster and Jennifer Lawrence took charge of the category. The Best Actor award was also presented by a female duo, instead of Emma Stone. Warren Beatty and Faye Dunaway were chosen to announce the Oscar for Best Picture, as a way of making amends for the previous ceremony's blunder."},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Actress","nominee_list":[{"type":"person","id":3910,"image_path":"/AskZbUslI8HkkbdmwyAXHjmQqPg.jpg","name":"Frances McDormand","winner":true,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":359940,"name":"Three Billboards Outside Ebbing, Missouri","image_path":"/v6xTMvGWWEReIs8B3BrVF8KYz4c.jpg","director":"Martin McDonagh","winner":true}},{"type":"person","id":39658,"image_path":"/osYgwtQIiNbPFc8JkFDxreBgqxZ.jpg","name":"Sally Hawkins","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":399055,"name":"The Shape of Water","image_path":"/hHPFq7myTjAVH6CwQjamAuUqhrr.jpg","director":"Guillermo del Toro","winner":true}},{"type":"person","id":36592,"image_path":"/4plcgNpHArZUTiYqgpQdGw4PZdT.jpg","name":"Saoirse Ronan","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":391713,"name":"Lady Bird","image_path":"/wxfKcpFPmK9isnxXyvCMbqmBtdg.jpg","director":"Greta Gerwig","winner":false}},{"type":"person","id":5064,"image_path":"/xqL5IJxV0fDeD3OfkS3eWqwJoGV.jpg","name":"Meryl Streep","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":446354,"name":"The Post","image_path":"/hOq5Pus5W2IwVcTdveu9tO6yYFB.jpg","director":"Steven Spielberg","winner":false}},{"type":"person","id":234352,"image_path":"/mzwuoK7i418q28KI8cQIFzKcWjg.jpg","name":"Margot Robbie","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":389015,"name":"I, Tonya","image_path":"/1awJ19hydmplGNib38L8solMBHY.jpg","director":"Craig Gillespie","winner":false}}]